      "title": {
        "en": "Practical Demonstration: mistake classification",
        "zh": "实践展示：按规则、执行与心理对交易错误分类"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate classifying trading mistakes by rule, execution and psychology. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示按规则、执行与心理对交易错误分类。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
      },
      "instructions": {
